                                        "entry_id": "aee3d8c1-0077-39ff-92b0-e6bbfd153e89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plunder taken from an enemy in time of war, or seized by piracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce0e0c83-bec5-44f5-8fc6-4533bbd110f8",
                                                "sense_id": "80df4c0a-3bc4-37cd-ac95-2cad1c4e49dd",
                                                "text": "The soldier gets his booty ; the combatant his spoils ; the carnivorous animal his prey. Booty respects what is of personal service to the captor ; spoils whatever serves to designate his triumph ; prey includes whatever gratifies the appetite and is to be consumed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71862a33-6b6b-462e-b6ba-8b6953a57d1e",
                                                "sense_id": "80df4c0a-3bc4-37cd-ac95-2cad1c4e49dd",
                                                "text": "Hungry for fame and the approval of rare-animal collector Queen Victoria (Imelda Staunton), Darwin deceives the Captain and his crew into believing they can get enough booty to win the pirate competition by entering Polly in a science fair. So the pirates journey to London in cheerful, blinkered defiance of the Queen, a hotheaded schemer whose royal crest reads simply “I hate pirates.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5081073-54e7-32c6-b907-21f8e9b54c4c",
                                        "entry_id": "aee3d8c1-0077-39ff-92b0-e6bbfd153e89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that has been stolen or illegally, mischievously, or greedily obtained from elsewhere."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e19e4fd-940e-4d64-9d98-09c3a8e83f80",
                                                "sense_id": "f5081073-54e7-32c6-b907-21f8e9b54c4c",
                                                "text": "After returning from their Halloween trick-or-treating, the kids settled down to enjoy their booty of candies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa87fd33-a977-4dcd-a669-8ac92d7fd9e5",
                                                "sense_id": "f5081073-54e7-32c6-b907-21f8e9b54c4c",
                                                "text": "[H]e ſtood ſtill till ſhe came to him, and then, ſpreading his arms in her way, caught her, loaded as ſhe was with the pieces of candles, with which ſhe had filled the forepart of her ſhift; for ſhe had, in her haste, forgot to bring any thing to carry them off. […] If ſhe ſpoke to refuſe him, ſhe knew her voice would betray her, and ſhe ſhould be exposed for ever, at the same time that the fear of loſing her booty prevented her letting go her hold to ſtruggle with him, and ſtrive to repel force by force."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "323c7ed7-0a58-4307-9d38-67b0a6221cb8",
                                                "sense_id": "f5081073-54e7-32c6-b907-21f8e9b54c4c",
                                                "text": "Booty and prey are often used in an extended sense. Plunderers obtain a rich booty ; the diligent bee returns loaded with its booty."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d7a2a74-0473-482f-aaed-123e3bd3d7a9",
                                                "sense_id": "f5081073-54e7-32c6-b907-21f8e9b54c4c",
                                                "text": "“Aw yeah, I'm rich! So rich, I'll never have to work again. But you will. We'll come back every day 'til that snout of yours is worn to the bone.” “It doesn't have a bone. It's boneless.” “Well, worn to a stump then. Yeah, you know what I mean. Now come on! We need to haul this booty to the surface.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
