                                                "sense_id": "61adf0aa-da4e-328a-b98c-6a08ab2a7f7f",
                                                "text": "Aah, everybody, get on the floor / Let's dance / Don't fight the feeling / Give yourself a chance / Shake shake shake, shake shake shake / Shake your booty, shake your booty / Oh, shake shake shake, shake shake shake / Shake your booty, shake your booty"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "341288f1-b237-4632-b80d-e24316447ef6",
                                                "sense_id": "61adf0aa-da4e-328a-b98c-6a08ab2a7f7f",
                                                "text": "After a triumphant performance at this year's American Music Awards, Toni [Braxton] walked offstage backward. \"It was a see-through dress,\" explains Singletary. \"She felt like her booty was her business.\" \"I wear provocative clothes because they make me feel sexy,\" Toni says without apology. \"If an artist like Madonna is wearing her booty hanging out, she's considered a genius. But if a black person does it, we're considered skank whores or sluts.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ec464f7-8bd4-4832-bcf5-286356b286a5",
                                                "sense_id": "61adf0aa-da4e-328a-b98c-6a08ab2a7f7f",
                                                "text": "She didn't like it when he touched her and indicated her clitoral area and buttocks. […] Patty also commented that her daddy has played with her vagina and put toys in [her] booty. […] Her father made her touch his private stuff, \"his penis and booty.\" […] In her sleep when Mrs. Porter was babysitting, Patty was observed to pull down her diaper and manipulate her clitoris and try to insert her finger into her \"booty\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aacb4f11-e460-48e3-8204-be7e96e2c0ef",
                                                "sense_id": "61adf0aa-da4e-328a-b98c-6a08ab2a7f7f",
                                                "text": "She hadn't even looked pregnant, especially with her clothes on. She'd gotten only one stretch mark. A thin, jagged line on her left booty cheek."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d53eafb7-1acb-479f-a8e8-4c1614055e1d",
                                                "sense_id": "61adf0aa-da4e-328a-b98c-6a08ab2a7f7f",
                                                "text": "When she turned her back to the mirror, the spandex in the material clung tightly to her booty. Ugh. She was even calling her derriere a \"booty,\" because that's what her eight-year-old, cartoon-watching nephew called it. Whatever the name for her overcurvaceous backside, it was the bane of her existence. She simply sat too much. Even the two ballet classes a week she took at work, in the hospital exercise studio, did not help. If anything, they made her \"booty\" even \"bootier\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
